Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=38}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:49.38,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,你們該提早結束這趟旅程了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:53.89,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,難道你們不知道這個國家是誰在幕後操控嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.89,0:01:55.35,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.06,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,是凱多吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:01:58.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們是來……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:01.93,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,打倒一個四皇的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:03.39,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:06.90,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,錦右衛門說過我們也不該說這種話！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.90,0:02:07.61,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼……？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.53,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,剛才是騙你的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:12.07,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我不知道是誰！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:24.33,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,你們兩個活過這個月的機率……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:31.59,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,只有百分之十九。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:37.30,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,對了，你那把刀是哪來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:41.31,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好像是把名刀，是也。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:49.19,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,對，我很確定這是把名刀。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:50.65,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,讓我看一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:55.07,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:58.45,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,反正你也不會用刀，就給我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:00.95,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我來把他們砍了，是也！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.45,0:03:02.25,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,衝啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:10.80,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這是刀劍對決，是也！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.13,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,別把刀鞘丟出去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:21.14,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:22.72,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}手槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:26.81,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那才不是什麼手槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:32.11,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,連蜥蜴都在追我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:35.57,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:45.91,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}稻草劍。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:11.15,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那是什麼刀啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:13.57,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那隻可憐的蜥蜴！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.12,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好快！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:56.69,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,真厲害。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:58.65,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,剛剛發生了什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.85,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}減一條命。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:39.07,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,這些稻草人代表我的部下。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:49.29,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,我能用藁藁能力把他們存進我體內……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:51.16,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,所以我不會受傷。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:55.25,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,只要存了十個，我就能死十次。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:14.15,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,那麼，來玩個遊戲吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:17.11,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,遊戲？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:21.78,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,沒錯……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:24.95,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,用這張稻草人卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:34.39,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,我可沒高尚到會跟兩個最惡世代公平對決。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:37.14,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這傢伙比我想的還難纏……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:40.52,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,不過我早該料到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.99,0:07:50.45,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,開始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:06.76,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}逆位的愚者！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:11.60,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,可惡，這代表內部不和。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:35.41,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,抱歉，下次我會抽到更好的牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:43.09,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,我必須承擔這些風險，\N因為有些牌能讓我突破極限。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:01.73,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！你在幹什麼，小子？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:04.52,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,霍金斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:06.73,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,不必害怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.20,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿玉！撐住啊，阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:15.49,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,她發燒得好燙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:18.37,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,難怪那隻狗這麼急。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.34,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,你們這些混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:26.09,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,別想逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:28.88,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,霍金斯！他們要逃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.43,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,我抽到一張好牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:41.23,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}逆位的教皇。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:44.98,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,追擊之牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:16.10,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.68,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,保護好那孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:22.39,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我來……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:28.98,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,對付……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:31.53,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這些傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:57.05,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你還挺能撐的嘛。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:09.82,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,釘子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:05.25,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二刀流……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.71,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}弐斬……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:14.46,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}登樓……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:17.72,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}砂紋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.29,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們要追上去嗎，霍金斯？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:02.22,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}教皇。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.93,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,這是援助之牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:10.06,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,會有人帶他們到安全的地方……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:15.32,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,真是個麻煩的傢伙……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:20.07,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那孩子怎麼樣了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:25.41,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好燙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.66,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,她的體溫一直在升高。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:28.50,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,狗狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:29.79,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,跑快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:58.73,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,咦？怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.66,0:14:06.83,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,等等……你是……？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.37,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你迷路了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.38,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我們沒時間可以浪費了……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:16.13,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,就……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:18.50,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,往右走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:20.51,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你應該往左走。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:26.60,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你們武士真是厲害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:29.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:34.44,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你擊退了霍金斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:36.94,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.69,0:14:42.74,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,我就是你剛才救的人，綠衣先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:50.49,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,我叫阿鶴。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:02.21,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你……一直都躲在牠的尾巴裡嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:05.30,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:09.39,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,謝謝你救了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.81,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,給你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:18.69,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,你至少能幫她擦擦汗嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:20.82,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喔！謝了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:24.40,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,希望我這樣說不會太冒昧……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:29.16,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,但能否讓我來照顧阿玉這孩子呢？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:30.66,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,妳認識她？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:31.41,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:33.70,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這樣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:34.83,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那就拜託妳了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:40.42,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,她太餓了，喝了被污染的河水。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.71,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,與其去找醫生……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:46.59,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,不如把她帶到我的茶館。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:47.72,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,茶？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:50.51,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,現在哪有時間喝茶啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:53.02,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,再不快點，她會死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:59.98,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我不認識這孩子，或許輪不到我多嘴，但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:01.65,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,不不……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:07.86,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,我們有一種藥草，對河水的毒很有效。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:12.53,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,那才是治療阿玉最好的辦法。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:17.92,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,原來如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:19.54,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那就拜託妳救救她！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:21.63,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,謝謝妳！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.26,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,為了報答你的恩情……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:28.72,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,也讓我招待你一下吧，綠衣先生……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:52.87,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,請用。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.79,0:16:58.41,Main-207+,Patron,0,0,0,,茶館的糰子可是難得的美味。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:02.25,Main-207+,Patron,0,0,0,,它們是唯一……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:05.50,Main-207+,Patron,0,0,0,,支撐我活下去的東西。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.80,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,妳太誇張了……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:15.31,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,很快妳就能像從前一樣，想吃多少就吃多少了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.27,Main-207+,Patron,0,0,0,,但願如此……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:29.82,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,喂，老頭，店要關門了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:31.82,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,滾出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.99,0:17:38.79,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,好啦，阿菊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:42.08,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,妳付不出街道稅吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:44.92,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我只是想幫妳而已。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:48.38,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,只要妳當我老婆……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:50.09,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,就不用工作了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:56.35,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,每天都能吃到農場來的美味食物，想吃多少就吃多少！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:01.31,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我們的身分地位相差太多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:04.06,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,如果您不點東西，是否可以請您……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:06.32,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,離開呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:09.28,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我才不想吃這種地方的東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:13.95,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,這裡的糰子和茶都是用別人的剩菜做的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:19.66,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,說起來，妳知道我是誰吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:24.42,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我可是花都來的知名橫綱。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:33.59,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我是和之國最強的相撲力士，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:38.22,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,浦島！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:41.81,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,妳也該離開這破茶館了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:48.36,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,妳得別再靠別人的剩飯過活，這樣妳跟我……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:51.36,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,這樣我們就能……妳懂的？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:54.28,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:03.29,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,阿鶴小姐！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:08.42,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,阿玉喝了河裡有毒的水！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:10.71,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,喔！那可嚴重了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:14.22,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,拜託！盡妳所能救救她！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:15.63,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:18.22,Main-207+,Tsuru,0,0,0,,快把五指草煎成藥！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:20.06,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,當然，我馬上來！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:20.68,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:24.69,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,你們這些蠢貨是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:27.27,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:28.48,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,讓開。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:29.56,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:33.57,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,我為什麼要讓開……？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.41,0:19:42.62,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,阿菊！我等一下在博羅鎮有場比賽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:47.37,Main-207+,Urashima,0,0,0,,有興趣的話，就來看看我有多強吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:57.76,Main-207+,Penguin,0,0,0,,是他們沒錯吧？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.51,Main-207+,Penguin,0,0,0,,是草帽一行人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:04.64,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,要不要趁他們惹麻煩前去告訴他們？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:06.18,Main-207+,Shachi,0,0,0,,你最好別去！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:09.60,Main-207+,Shachi,0,0,0,,你會引人注意的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.11,0:20:14.99,Main-207+,Penguin,0,0,0,,總之，我們先把這件事回報給船長吧。
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=39}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=36}=============================TITLE AND SIGNS==============================
